    {
      "name": "Constrict",
      "type": "weapon",
      "system": {
        "description": {
          "value": "<section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-3TuogRqiHnJaEJGH\"><p><em>Melee Weapon Attack:</em> +5 to hit, reach 10 ft., one creature. Hit: 13 (3d6 + 3) bludgeoning damage. If the target is Medium or smaller, it is &amp;Reference[grappled]{grappled} (escape DC 13) and pulled 5 feet toward the water weird. Until this grapple ends, the target is &amp;Reference[restrained]{restrained}, the water weird tries to drown it, and the water weird can’t constrict another target.</p></section><p>The weird constricts its target. If the target is Medium or smaller, it is &amp;Reference[grappled]{grappled} (escape [[/check ability=strength dc=13]]) and pulled 5 feet toward the water weird. Until this grapple ends, the target is &amp;Reference[restrained]{restrained}, the water weird tries to drown it, and the water weird can’t constrict another target.</p>",
          "chat": ""
        },
